  agent, i.e. the user is good and the group matched. The denial is view access: the group's
  read view name resolves to nothing, and VACM with an empty/undefined view permits no OID.
  => This is a DEFECT IN THE AUTHORED TEST CASE, not in the platform. Logged as O-9.
  => Reported to the Test Engineer as a notice (section 9); the case was then run with the
     one missing line supplied, which is the only reading under which its nine steps mean
     anything.

