--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
N1 The §3 occupancy check is still FOUND (exit 5): `ser2net` (pid 744, box infrastructure)
   and `minicom -D /dev/ttyUSB1` (pid 10790, your own session on u1). u1 is not in this
